Set the multiplier node's Number Multiplier widget to 25, so the factor stays a setting you can change later:

```json
{
  "nodeId": "f325441e-55be-4415-aa1b-b2055f590de2",
  "widgets": {
    "number_multiplier": 25
  }
}
```

Both depth layers read the period from the Projection period node. Set its timeline widget to "2050 - 2080":

```json
{
  "nodeId": "c7246f52-d977-5353-9951-bcb855d2ebda",
  "widgets": {
    "timeline": "2050 - 2080"
  }
}
```
